Purgatory is a an advanced [[Fight]]ing zone accessed through the [[Portal]]. In addition to increased idle speed and accuracy penalties, this zone features 21 unique enemies over 100 encounters. Clearing the Purgatory unlocks [[The Bog]]. Minimum attack needed for Flatclot is 130 without modifiers.

The following table shows the '''base''' values for each monster in the zone. (Note: '''<span style="color:PaleTurquoise">1</span>''' = 1000 QQ)

